# ROMAN VERSION 

Aapko WhatsApp ke madhyam se ek verification link bheja jaayega.

Us sandesh mein aapke ghar ke pate ki jaanch shuru karne ke liye ek link hoga.

Us link par click karke aage badhein.

Link kholne ke baad aapse bhasha chunne ke liye kaha jaayega.

Aap apni pasand ki bhasha chun sakte hain —
English, Hindi, Kannada, Tamil, Telugu ya Bangla.

Bhasha chunne ke baad aapko “Nirdesh Video” dikhai dega.

Maargdarshan ke liye aap video dekh sakte hain ya seedhe aage badh sakte hain.

Ab aapke mobile number par OTP bheja gaya hai.

OTP darj karein aur aage badhein.

Login karne ke baad Google Maps par aapka panjikrit pata dikhai dega.

Ab “Apne ghar ke pate ki jaanch karein”
aur “Apni maujooda jagah ki jaanch karein”.

Yadi location sahi hai to
“Yeh jagah sahi hai” par click karein.

Yadi location sahi nahin hai to
“Yeh jagah sahi nahin hai” chunen aur GSS team se sampark karein.

Ab “Pata ke vistaar” mein jaankari darj karein.

“Paas ka jaana-pehchaana sthan” darj karein.

“Paas ka police thana” darj karein.

Phir “Makaan ka prakaar” chunen.

Aur batayen ki
“Yahaan kitne samay se reh rahe hain”.

Ab chunen ki
“Ghar ke pate ki jaanch kaun karega”.

Yadi aap swayam karna chahte hain to
“Khud” chunen.

Yadi kisi aur se karwana chahte hain to
“Koi aur” chunen.

Yadi aap “Koi aur” chunen:

“Aavedak ke saath sambandh” chunen.

“Poora naam” darj karein.

“10 ankon ka WhatsApp number” darj karein.

Is WhatsApp number par ek verification link bheja jaayega.

Phir “Save karein aur aage badhein” par click karein.

Yadi aap “Khud” chunen:

“Photo kheenchhein” par click karein.

Sabse pehle “Apni selfie lein”.

Phir “Ghar ke bahar sadak ki photo lein”.

Uske baad “Ghar ke number ke saath baahari darwaze ki photo lein”.

Photo upload karne ke baad aap sabhi jaankari ki samiksha kar sakte hain.

Agar sab kuch sahi hai to
“Submit karein” par click karein.

Is prakaar aapki ghar ke pate ki jaanch prakriya poori ho jaayegi।


